namespace pdg { /**

\var pdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent
\ingroup Events
\brief An enabled Spriter animation crosses an authored eventline key.

Call pdg::Sprite::enableSpriterEvents(true) and register an IEventHandler for this
event type. The payload is pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent. Authored clip time and the
offset within the current update are floating-point seconds.

\sa pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent
\sa \ref animation_trigger_event

**/ }
